                                                "sense_id": "07885927-e37e-331e-9ef1-2e12078880bc",
                                                "text": "Fitness coach Powell was awake and talking throughout the procedure last month at the Cardiff branch of Signature Clinic, a cosmetic surgery group which for the past year has averaged 100 gynecomastia patients a month across its six locations in UK and Ireland."
